        "created_at": "2011-08-16T02:37:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A question was asked in <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,42.0.html\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this thread</a> about the interaction between Savage Mana and Ammo Drop; in particular:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Does Bunker draw a card due to Ammo Drop when cards are placed beneath Savage Mana?</li>\n<li>Does Bunker draw a card due to Ammo Drop when a card beneath Savage mana is destroyed?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The answer is “yes” on both counts.  Villain Cards are always Villain Cards, so in this unusual case, a given card can actually be destroyed twice, and make Bunker draw twice with Ammo Drop.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
