        "raw": "A question was asked in [url=http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,42.0.html]this thread[/url] about the interaction between Savage Mana and Ammo Drop; in particular:\n[list type=decimal]\n[*]Does Bunker draw a card due to Ammo Drop when cards are placed beneath Savage Mana?\n[*]Does Bunker draw a card due to Ammo Drop when a card beneath Savage mana is destroyed?\n[/list]\n\nThe answer is \"yes\" on both counts.  Villain Cards are always Villain Cards, so in this unusual case, a given card can actually be destroyed twice, and make Bunker draw twice with Ammo Drop.",
